<div id="text-cb1b333925" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>Breakthrough AI Acceleration With Huge Memory</h4>
<p>The AMD Instinct™ MI350 Series GPUs redefine AI acceleration with next-gen MXFP6 and MXFP4 datatype support, optimizing efficiency, bandwidth, and energy use for lightning-fast AI inference and training.</p>
<p>Designed to fuel performance of the most demanding AI models, Instinct MI350 GPUs boast a massive 288GB of HBM3E memory and 8TB/s bandwidth, delivering a huge leap in performance over previous generations.<sup>1</sup></p>

