    <div class="text text-light aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div id="text-bb279f0031" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>More Performance. Fewer Dollars.</h4>
<p>Achieve leadership OPEX versus the NVIDIA H200 NVL card through lower precision MXFP6 and MXFP4 data types, more HBM3E memory more, raw performance and an open low and no-cost software ecosystem for generative and agentic AI workloads.</p>

</div>

    


