    <h3 style="text-align: center;">Hear From Our OEM Partners</h3>

</div>

    


</div>
<div class="carousel aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div data-component="cmp-carousel" id="carousel-f13b26a7ed" class="glide false " role="group" aria-live="polite" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-cmp-is="glide" data-cmp-delay="5000" data-cmp-type="carousel" data-placeholder-text="false" data-carousel-autoplay="false">

	<div class="glide__track" data-glide-el="track">
		<div class="glide__slides" aria-atomic="false" aria-live="polite">
			<article id="carousel-f13b26a7ed-item-6df4509bc8-tabpanel" class="glide__slide glide__slide--active" aria-labelledby="carousel-f13b26a7ed-item-6df4509bc8-tab" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Slide 1 of 6" data-cmp-hook-carousel="item"><div class="container-parsys">
    
    
    
    <div id="container-6df4509bc8" class="cmp-container " data-component="cmp-container">
        
        
        <div class="cmp-container__content   ">
            
            


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="pullquote text-light text-small gold aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><aside data-cmp-is="pullquote" class="pullquote">
    <figure>For enterprises serious about AI, on-premises infrastructure isn’t a compromise. It’s a competitive advantage delivering the control, security and predictable outcomes that matter most. Dell PowerEdge servers paired with the AMD Instinct MI350P PCIe card gives customers a direct path to that advantage. Together, Dell and AMD offer industry-leading AI compute power and performance so enterprises can stop evaluating and start innovating.</figure>
    <figcaption>David Schmidt, Vice President, Product Management, Dell Technologies</figcaption>
</aside>

    

</div>

    
</div>

        </div>
    </div>

    
